{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08519","headline":"与诸公送陈郎将归衡阳 · 李白","name":"与诸公送陈郎将归衡阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衡山苍苍入紫冥，下看南极老人星。\n回飙吹散五峰雪，往往飞花落洞庭。\n气清岳秀有如此，郎将一家拖金紫。\n门前食客乱浮云，世人皆比孟尝君。\n江上送行无白璧，临歧惆怅若爲分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}